{"id":45903,"ord":97,"n_segments":182,"prev":45902,"next":45904,"doc":{"id":"56706","title":"56706_Buddy Tate oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Buddy Tate","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/56706/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=56706"},"chapter":"Marriages, family and loss","title":"Ethel Mayes as second wife and their child","category":"health_personal","summary":"He married Ethel Mayes, whose band he worked in, and their child was born while he was with Basie.","period":"1933-40","year_from":1933,"year_to":1933,"words":113,"start":[121,2],"end":[122,3],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=56706#s45903","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Ethel Mays's band","focus":1,"leader":"Ethel Mays"},{"name":"Count Basie Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Count Basie"}]},"people":[{"name":"Ethel Mayes","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":43,"theme_name":"Meeting, marrying and raising a family","community":84,"community_name":"Meeting, courting and marrying: musicians' love lives","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":121,"b":2,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"Then I had a child by the one, the band leader I told you about. That's the one I just lost in July. You remember I told you --"},{"p":121,"b":3,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"The woman band....."},{"p":121,"b":4,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"Her name was Ethel Mayes."},{"p":121,"b":5,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":121,"b":6,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"And I worked in her band and we had a child."},{"p":121,"b":7,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"But you didn't marry?"},{"p":121,"b":8,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"Yeah, we married."},{"p":121,"b":9,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"Oh, she was your second wife."},{"p":121,"b":10,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"Uh-huh. See, after one died, then I married her."},{"p":121,"b":11,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"In 1936."},{"p":121,"b":12,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"No, in 1933, '34."},{"p":121,"b":13,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":121,"b":14,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"See, right during -- as a matter of fact,"},{"p":122,"b":0,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"I was with her when I was with the Basie band, you know, in the first Basie band."},{"p":122,"b":1,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"Oh, I see."},{"p":122,"b":2,"s":"MR. TATE","x":"She was pregnant then."},{"p":122,"b":3,"s":"MR. GIDDINS","x":"Right."}]}